WEBVTT

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.160
(soft music playing)

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.920
(train rattling)

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.920
(soft music continues)

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.040
-Thank you. -Would you
like something else?

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:05.880
No. No, no, not just yet.
I'm waiting.

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.120
I'm expecting someone.

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.640
(sighs)

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.640
(soft music continues)

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.760
-(soft rumbling) -(wind whistles)

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:39.880
(faint rattle)

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:54.960
Would this be one of
your regular haunts?

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.440
I don't have any regular haunts.
(chuckles)

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.720
Let me see it.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.320
(Grindelwald sighs)

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.240
Sometimes I imagine I still
feel it around my neck.

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:23.880
I carried it for so many years.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.280
How does it feel around yours?

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:30.080
We can free each other of it.

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:32.960
(Grindelwald sighs)

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:37.440
Love to chatter, don't
they, our Muggle friends.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:40.800
Though one must admit, they
make a good cup of tea.

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.520
What you're doing is madness.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:47.840
It's what we said we'd do.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.920
-I was young. I was... -Committed.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.400
To me.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.920
To us.

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:57.600
No.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.840
I went along because...
(inhales sharply)

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:03.560
Because?

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.720
Because I was in love with you.

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:08.480
Yes.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.640
But that's not why you went along.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:16.000
It was you who said we
could reshape the world.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:18.720
That it was our birthright.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:19.960
(chain rattles)

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.840
Can you smell it? The stench.

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:43.800
(sighs)

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:46.920
Do you really intend to turn
your back on your own kind?

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.640
For these animals?

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.640
(tense music playing)

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:54.560
With or without you, I'll
burn down their world, Albus.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:58.320
There's nothing you
can do to stop me.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.040
Enjoy your cup of tea.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.720
(cup clinking)

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.560
(deep rumbling)

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:19.040
(suspenseful music playing)

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.520
(sweeping orchestral music playing)

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.920
(creatures calling in distance)

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.920
(creature moaning in distance)

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.840
(chattering)

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.200
She's ready.

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.920
(ethereal music playing)

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.640
(creature moaning)

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:31.760
(Newt pants)

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.120
(creature grunting)

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:40.040
(creature groans)

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.200
(creature moans)

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.040
(pained breathing)

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.360
(roaring in pain)

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.480
(screeches)

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:58.680
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.040
(squelching)

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:13.520
-(Newt gasps) -(trilling)

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.440
(ethereal music playing)

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:23.680
(Qilin snorting)

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:28.640
Beautiful.

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:32.240
All right, you two.

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:35.160
Now, the tricky bit.

